  {
    "id": 7002001010020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "最初の審査、通過したって……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。おめでとう、灯織！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……はい、ありがとうございます",
    "charAnim1": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim1Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "本当によくやったよ！",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、はづきさんから聞いたとき驚いたけど\r\nこの調子で行けば、きっと――",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……プロデューサー、少しは落ち着いてください",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "まだ先があるということ、わかっているんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……そうだな\r\nちょっと喜びすぎたよな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……灯織はいつも落ち着いていて、偉いな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "だから、そうやって安易に褒めるのもやめて……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうしたんだ？　灯織",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ……少し、思い出しただけです",
    "charAnim1": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim1Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "最初にプロデューサーに会った頃のことを……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "最初……？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい。あの頃は、あなたにプロデュースを任せて\r\n大丈夫か考えていたんです",
    "charAnim1": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charAnim1Loop": false,
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それって、灯織を不安にさせてたってことか？",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "いえ、不安とは違いますが……\r\nとにかく、もう終わった話です",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "今はそんなことは考えていません",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7002001010130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー\r\nこれからもプロデュース、よろしくお願いします",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/700200101/7002001010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ！　こちらこそ、よろしく頼むよ",
